- providers: each has code (string, required), name (string, optional? In examples it's present. Let me require code, name optional with default ''), off_peak (nullable object with window_start, window_end, multiplier).
- models: provider, code required.
- prices: provider, model, valid_from (ISO), currency (default 'USD'), unit (required, one of the two), rates (object of decimal strings, non-empty). valid_from parse to DateTimeImmutable UTC.

